, g\u7917\'3fi v\'e0 b\u7843\'3fo v\u7879\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\u7899\'3fi B\u7897\'3f K\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\'e0 }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'d0\u7847\'3f}{\f0\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 u t}{
