\par b. N\u7897\'3fi dung k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch t\'e0i ch\'ednh ph\u7843\'3fi th\u7875\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \u7847\'3fy }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'f0}{
