ng d\u7921\'3f \'e1n th\'e0nh ph\u7847\'3fn, k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch n\'e0y ph\u7843\'3fi bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch v\u7889\'3fn vay ADB v\u7873\'3f cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng n\'f4ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3f
n n\'f4ng th\'f4n vay l\u7841\'3fi.
\par c. Khi k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'f0}{\f47\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'fd\u7907\'3f}{\f0\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 c Qu\u7889\'3fc h\u7897\'3fi ph\'ea duy\u7879\'3ft, B\u7897\'3f Thu\u7927\'3f s
\u7843\'3fn tri\u7875\'3fn khai ph\'e2n b\u7893\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'f0}{\f0\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'e3 }{\f39\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'f0}{\f47\insrsid11606436\charrsid11606436 \'fd
